  "instruction_steps": [
    {
      "step_number": 1,
      "instruction": "Heat grill to very hot. Slice the aubergines in half lengthways, then grill for 25 mins, turning occasionally, until soft – the skin will remain firm, but the flesh will soften. Lift the aubergines off the grill and leave until cool enough to handle.",
      "timer_seconds": 1500,
      "ingredients_used": [
        "42a1f7a0-8439-534e-bf0e-73d471387715"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 2,
      "instruction": "Using a sharp knife, score the grilled flesh and scoop out the flesh with a spoon. Tip into a bowl and mash with a fork until you get a thick pulp. Beat in the lemon juice and garlic. Add the yogurt and dill, and season. Serve while still warm.",
